bftee (1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix stdin EOF detection when upstream process terminates.
  * Use select() with non-blocking I/O for proper pipe closure handling.
  * Add 100ms timeout to detect closed stdin more reliably.
  * Ensure queue is still flushed even during select timeouts.

 -- Andrew Walker <andrew.walker@sohonet.com>  Sun, 11 Aug 2025 12:00:00 +0000

bftee (1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * Non-blocking tee for FIFOs with configurable buffer size.
  * Signal handling for statistics and graceful shutdown.
  * Automatic reconnection handling for FIFO readers.

 -- Andrew Walker <andrew.walker@sohonet.com>  Wed, 09 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000
